          "name": "t:names.content",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Where We Ship</h3><p>We ship worldwide from our warehouse in Heidelberg, Germany. Catalog orders are typically dispatched within 1–2 business days of confirmation. Delivery timing depends on your destination and the service selected at checkout.</p><h3>Delivery Options &amp; Rates</h3><p>Shipping rates are calculated at checkout based on your delivery address, selected market, and chosen service. If your order qualifies for complimentary shipping, that will be shown automatically before you pay.</p><p>Where an express option is available, it will appear at checkout together with the delivery estimate for your destination. You will receive a tracking link as soon as your order has been dispatched.</p><h3>VAT &amp; Duties</h3><p>For customers within the European Union, VAT is included where applicable. Customers outside the EU — including the United Kingdom, Switzerland, the United States, and other destinations — may be subject to local import duties and taxes upon delivery. These charges are set by the destination country's customs authority and are the responsibility of the recipient.</p><p>Your final checkout total reflects the pricing and currency available for your selected market.</p><h3>About Our Fulfilment</h3><p>Our pieces are sourced directly from artisan partners in Zimbabwe and held at our warehouse in Heidelberg, Germany. This model allows us to maintain tight quality control and get your order to you as efficiently as possible, wherever you are.</p><p><strong>Warehouse address:</strong><br>Penya Collective<br>Steinhofweg 47<br>69118 Heidelberg, Germany<br>Tel: <a href=\"tel:+4915147416152\">+49 1514 7416152</a></p><h3>Returns &amp; Exchanges</h3><p>We accept returns within 14 days of delivery for unworn items in original condition with tags attached. To start a return, email <a href=\"mailto:info@penya.africa\">info@penya.africa</a> with your order number and reason for return. Return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer unless the item is faulty or incorrectly sent.</p><p>Custom or final-sale items are non-returnable.</p>",
